 ('5bab5d55-d3cd-5f9a-b847-8b1efebfad26', 'tts/openai/5bab5d55-d3cd-5f9a-b847-8b1efebfad26.mp3', 'I have heard of thee by the hearing of the ear: but now mine eye seeth thee.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 8.593, 76, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('7e5d7062-d5ad-57ea-a978-c2944e8e7b09', 'tts/openai/7e5d7062-d5ad-57ea-a978-c2944e8e7b09.mp3', 'Wherefore I abhor myself, and repent in dust and ashes.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 0.577, 55, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('dd57a629-8403-5b84-b005-0d296c0fadbc', 'tts/openai/dd57a629-8403-5b84-b005-0d296c0fadbc.mp3', 'And it was so, that after the Lord had spoken these words unto Job, the Lord said to Eliphaz the Temanite, My wrath is kindled against thee, and against thy two friends: for ye have not spoken of me the thing that is right, as my servant Job hath.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 4.55, 247, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('a179b7e1-4e14-5f5b-849d-d771ebb40552', 'tts/openai/a179b7e1-4e14-5f5b-849d-d771ebb40552.mp3', 'Then came there unto him all his brethren, and all his sisters, and all they that had been of his acquaintance before, and did eat bread with him in his house: and they bemoaned him, and comforted him over all the evil that the Lord had brought upon him: every man also gave him a piece of money, and every one an earring of gold.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 2.353, 330, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('5228e059-a9c0-5761-b888-2614d7e97a66', 'tts/openai/5228e059-a9c0-5761-b888-2614d7e97a66.mp3', 'So the Lord blessed the latter end of Job more than his beginning: for he had fourteen thousand sheep, and six thousand camels, and a thousand yoke of oxen, and a thousand she asses.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 4.452, 182, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('7b5ba31f-4cd5-5f88-9586-c77bcec0e0fe', 'tts/openai/7b5ba31f-4cd5-5f88-9586-c77bcec0e0fe.mp3', 'He had also seven sons and three daughters.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 4.525, 43, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('46a4d96c-6be2-519b-9cbb-47df8204c211', 'tts/openai/46a4d96c-6be2-519b-9cbb-47df8204c211.mp3', 'And he called the name of the first, Jemima; and the name of the second, Kezia; and the name of the third, Kerenhappuch.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 5.776, 120, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('01fadb89-460b-5564-b825-7e7869993e2e', 'tts/openai/01fadb89-460b-5564-b825-7e7869993e2e.mp3', 'After this lived Job an hundred and forty years, and saw his sons, and his sons'' sons, even four generations.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 7.608, 109, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('d91bfc65-6b9e-54bd-b13d-faf00bba3700', 'tts/openai/d91bfc65-6b9e-54bd-b13d-faf00bba3700.mp3', 'So Job died, being old and full of days.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 6.806, 40, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('0060ba2d-0b09-5ae8-9e5e-3ec31f542142', 'tts/openai/0060ba2d-0b09-5ae8-9e5e-3ec31f542142.mp3', 'Arise, shine, for your light has come, and the glory of the Lord has dawned upon you. For behold, darkness covers the land; deep gloom enshrouds the peoples. But over you the Lord will rise, and his glory will appear upon you. Nations will stream to your light, and kings to the brightness of your dawning. Your gates will always be open; by day or night they will never be shut. They will call you, The City of the Lord, The Zion of the Holy One of Israel. Violence will no more be heard in your land, ruin or destruction within your borders. You will call your walls, Salvation, and all your portals, Praise. The sun will no more be your light by day; by night you will not need the brightness of the moon. The Lord will be your everlasting light, and your God will be your glory. Glory to the Father, and to the Son, and to the Holy Spirit: as it was in the beginning, is now, and will be for ever.', 'text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 7.225, 901, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('8b1e85be-b848-5c48-9ecd-7285e762e1d2', 'tts/openai/8b1e85be-b848-5c48-9ecd-7285e762e1d2.mp3', 'A Reading (Lesson) from ACts, chapter 16, verses 16 to 24.', 'leader', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 5.302, 58, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('ee7d2b44-a7de-55e0-940a-6098ad4af667', 'tts/openai/ee7d2b44-a7de-55e0-940a-6098ad4af667.mp3', 'And it came to pass, as we went to prayer, a certain damsel possessed with a spirit of divination met us, which brought her masters much gain by soothsaying: of divination: or, of Python', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 6.948, 186, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('8a6a90ed-8f31-5352-a199-eb4414cc7e25', 'tts/openai/8a6a90ed-8f31-5352-a199-eb4414cc7e25.mp3', 'The same followed Paul and us, and cried, saying, These men are the servants of the most high God, which shew unto us the way of salvation.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 8.818, 139, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('6c076e68-49b6-5eaf-8112-8f60e6a66733', 'tts/openai/6c076e68-49b6-5eaf-8112-8f60e6a66733.mp3', 'And this did she many days. But Paul, being grieved, turned and said to the spirit, I command thee in the name of Jesus Christ to come out of her. And he came out the same hour.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 3.109, 177, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('85c6605a-9526-55a6-b410-e515dbd2071c', 'tts/openai/85c6605a-9526-55a6-b410-e515dbd2071c.mp3', 'And when her masters saw that the hope of their gains was gone, they caught Paul and Silas, and drew them into the marketplace unto the rulers, marketplace: or, court', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 4.771, 166, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('5a4e9c28-99f5-5278-8232-bfc7113bb713', 'tts/openai/5a4e9c28-99f5-5278-8232-bfc7113bb713.mp3', 'And the multitude rose up together against them: and the magistrates rent off their clothes, and commanded to beat them.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 8.424, 120, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
