 ('684e801e-1eec-551d-84d8-55124cbc83ce', 'tts/openai/684e801e-1eec-551d-84d8-55124cbc83ce.mp3', 'Who, having received such a charge, thrust them into the inner prison, and made their feet fast in the stocks.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 3.334, 110, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('53c3073e-d837-5861-a578-c40757f4e00b', 'tts/openai/53c3073e-d837-5861-a578-c40757f4e00b.mp3', 'O God, forasmuch as without thee we are not able to please thee, mercifully grant that thy Holy Spirit may in all things direct and rule our hearts; through Jesus Christ our Lord, who with thee and the same Spirit liveth and reigneth, one God, now and for ever.', 'text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 6.009, 261, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('0d28e326-1142-556e-89e4-f9c4fecde51a', 'tts/openai/0d28e326-1142-556e-89e4-f9c4fecde51a.mp3', 'O God, who by the preaching of thy blessed servant and bishop Ninian didst cause the light of the Gospel to shine in the land of Britain: Grant, we beseech thee, that, having his life and labors in remembrance, we may show forth our thankfulness by following the example of his zeal and patience; through Jesus Christ our Lord, who liveth and reigneth with thee and the Holy Spirit, one God, for ever and ever.', 'text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 5.342, 410, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('7fad5c6d-e0e8-54ad-9084-561d481ed76e', 'tts/openai/7fad5c6d-e0e8-54ad-9084-561d481ed76e.mp3', 'O Lord, our heavenly Father, almighty and everlasting God, who hast safely brought us to the beginning of this day: Defend us in the same with thy mighty power; and grant that this day we fall into no sin, neither run into any kind of danger; but that we, being ordered by thy governance, may do always what is righteous in thy sight; through Jesus Christ our Lord.', 'text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 7.682, 365, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('78bf3c9b-dcd3-535d-b2f4-c86b176a59f6', 'tts/openai/78bf3c9b-dcd3-535d-b2f4-c86b176a59f6.mp3', 'Psalm 119, verses 73 to 96', 'text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 2.238, 26, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('9939b2cc-9d90-5137-88ce-1fc1db557b65', 'tts/openai/9939b2cc-9d90-5137-88ce-1fc1db557b65.mp3', 'JOD. Thy hands have made me and fashioned me: give me understanding, that I may learn thy commandments.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 2.223, 103, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('292ecd2a-93cc-5f51-aef5-4cd557bf8100', 'tts/openai/292ecd2a-93cc-5f51-aef5-4cd557bf8100.mp3', 'They that fear thee will be glad when they see me; because I have hoped in thy word.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 6.458, 84, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('8d8ccc85-ee1f-591c-a1ac-eb41faef7a66', 'tts/openai/8d8ccc85-ee1f-591c-a1ac-eb41faef7a66.mp3', 'I know, O Lord, that thy judgments are right, and that thou in faithfulness hast afflicted me. right: Heb. righteousness', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 5.805, 120, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('10ca5a33-9c79-54ca-839f-e5e4fb5a0e21', 'tts/openai/10ca5a33-9c79-54ca-839f-e5e4fb5a0e21.mp3', 'Let, I pray thee, thy merciful kindness be for my comfort, according to thy word unto thy servant. for: Heb. to comfort me', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 0.563, 122, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('ad1d5536-07e5-5ba7-89ed-c28dd59057f8', 'tts/openai/ad1d5536-07e5-5ba7-89ed-c28dd59057f8.mp3', 'Let thy tender mercies come unto me, that I may live: for thy law is my delight.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 9.214, 80, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('d77c7989-235c-57c0-a8b8-256e29ecc838', 'tts/openai/d77c7989-235c-57c0-a8b8-256e29ecc838.mp3', 'Let the proud be ashamed; for they dealt perversely with me without a cause: but I will meditate in thy precepts.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 9.262, 113, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('6a1ebefc-e4ce-56df-afd7-ae23004020bf', 'tts/openai/6a1ebefc-e4ce-56df-afd7-ae23004020bf.mp3', 'Let those that fear thee turn unto me, and those that have known thy testimonies.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 4.69, 81, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('d497b1b5-3489-5c61-9018-4f525dae3925', 'tts/openai/d497b1b5-3489-5c61-9018-4f525dae3925.mp3', 'Let my heart be sound in thy statutes; that I be not ashamed.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 6.857, 61, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
