 ('88a5404f-253d-5569-b928-38cee794be55', 'tts/openai/88a5404f-253d-5569-b928-38cee794be55.mp3', 'For I am become like a bottle in the smoke; yet do I not forget thy statutes.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 4.127, 77, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('7bd190f2-d86c-55c5-a4fb-db88a2000b42', 'tts/openai/7bd190f2-d86c-55c5-a4fb-db88a2000b42.mp3', 'How many are the days of thy servant? when wilt thou execute judgment on them that persecute me?', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 8.327, 96, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('18fe4b28-ec3d-568e-8bf6-9cdb254c2176', 'tts/openai/18fe4b28-ec3d-568e-8bf6-9cdb254c2176.mp3', 'All thy commandments are faithful: they persecute me wrongfully; help thou me. faithful: Heb. faithfulness', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 5.465, 106, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('cc590035-e777-5fc2-8b8a-847c0554de5c', 'tts/openai/cc590035-e777-5fc2-8b8a-847c0554de5c.mp3', 'They had almost consumed me upon earth; but I forsook not thy precepts.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 3.502, 71, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('440129ff-50d1-5ef7-bf1f-d5c8722b0601', 'tts/openai/440129ff-50d1-5ef7-bf1f-d5c8722b0601.mp3', 'Quicken me after thy lovingkindness; so shall I keep the testimony of thy mouth.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 1.316, 80, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('8dbe09f3-17f9-5469-937f-98795eb5a02d', 'tts/openai/8dbe09f3-17f9-5469-937f-98795eb5a02d.mp3', 'Lamed. For ever, O Lord, thy word is settled in heaven.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 4.606, 55, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('e9580294-4921-5d59-adc3-06aef0e402ab', 'tts/openai/e9580294-4921-5d59-adc3-06aef0e402ab.mp3', 'Thy faithfulness is unto all generations: thou hast established the earth, and it abideth. unto: Heb. to generation and generation abideth: Heb. standeth', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 2.23, 153, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('1a47f5a8-0e85-589f-b516-5ba29f591707', 'tts/openai/1a47f5a8-0e85-589f-b516-5ba29f591707.mp3', 'They continue this day according to thine ordinances: for all are thy servants.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 4.228, 79, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('6689c74c-14da-5ac0-8189-d3a285d00e46', 'tts/openai/6689c74c-14da-5ac0-8189-d3a285d00e46.mp3', 'Unless thy law had been my delights, I should then have perished in mine affliction.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 1.207, 84, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('2cc3ba55-5084-5692-bf94-cbb3a5efbc8b', 'tts/openai/2cc3ba55-5084-5692-bf94-cbb3a5efbc8b.mp3', 'I will never forget thy precepts: for with them thou hast quickened me.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 2.506, 71, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('46afaa6c-1401-554f-9973-22ca3eabc052', 'tts/openai/46afaa6c-1401-554f-9973-22ca3eabc052.mp3', 'I am thine, save me; for I have sought thy precepts.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 8.653, 52, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('960ae131-120a-5449-857f-662346da8ab0', 'tts/openai/960ae131-120a-5449-857f-662346da8ab0.mp3', 'The wicked have waited for me to destroy me: but I will consider thy testimonies.', 'reading_text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 6.112, 81, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
