 ('72b723e6-8781-5b67-a37e-20810ef92665', 'tts/openai/72b723e6-8781-5b67-a37e-20810ef92665.mp3', 'O BE joyful in the Lord, all ye lands: serve the Lord with gladness, and come before his presence with a song. Be ye sure that the Lord he is God; it is he that hath made us, and not we ourselves: we are his people, and the sheep of his pasture. O go your way into his gates with thanksgiving, and into his courts with praise: be thankful unto him, and speak good of his Name. For the Lord is gracious, his mercy is everlasting: and his truth endureth from generation to generation. Glory be to the Father, and to the Son: and to the Holy Ghost; As it was in the beginning, is now, and ever shall be: world without end.', 'text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 8.48, 619, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
 ('582575a3-83e4-5feb-8111-debab289b27f', 'tts/openai/582575a3-83e4-5feb-8111-debab289b27f.mp3', 'I Believe in God the Father Almighty, Maker of heaven and earth: And in Jesus Christ his only Son our Lord: Who was conceived by the Holy Ghost, Born of the Virgin Mary: Suffered under Pontius Pilate, Was crucified, dead, and buried: He descended into hell; The third day he rose again from the dead: He ascended into heaven, And sitteth on the right hand of God the Father Almighty: From thence he shall come to judge the quick and the dead. I believe in the Holy Ghost: The holy Catholick Church; The Communion of Saints: The Forgiveness of sins: The Resurrection of the body, And the Life everlasting.', 'text', 'line', 'openai', 'cedar', 'gpt-4o-mini-tts', 1.0, 3.117, 604, 'en', 'difftest', NULL, now(), now()),
